    fixed: ["<del>its definitely</del> → it's definitely", '<del>I use it for some purposes - do my homework, play games and to communicate</del> → I use it for many purposes: doing homework, playing games and communicating', '<del>feature 특색</del> → 기능 · <del>application 신청</del> → 앱', '«Pointless inventions» 6쪽 → Guess 타일 + ⭕❌ 로 줄임'],
